Package: purrdometer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Marek Kudlacz <marek@kudlacz.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, bluez (>= 5.50), adduser, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pil, python3-spidev, python3-smbus2, python3-gpiozero, python3-lgpio, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: network-manager, sqlite3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: cat-wheel odometer: BLE cadence sensor logger, e-paper display, web dashboard
 purrdometer-logger reads a Bluetooth LE Cycling Speed & Cadence sensor and
 stores wheel rotations in SQLite. purrdometer-display shows rotations,
 distance and history on a Waveshare 2.13" Touch e-Paper HAT, and
 purrdometer-web serves the same as a web dashboard.
 .
 The package also configures BlueZ for a 6 s LE supervision timeout and turns
 off WiFi power-save, which keeps the BLE link stable on a Pi Zero 2 W.
